From 47be7884fae6b66fb7ecd3c898345e713e2ff5c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:38:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/78] Finish Initialize_GameEnvironment: sprite sets, border,
 handler tables

Ports H035+$0246 (24x24 sprite set pairs), H029+$0EFE (colour remap),
H006+$00FA (border tiles into the 8x8 set) and the two routines that
fill the H005 handler tables, H027+$4276 and H033+$1A50. The tables
($25C0 and $2832) become C arrays of function pointers; their 175
targets are stubs until ported. H005 $3244 becomes g_sprite_sets.
The program now runs the whole environment setup and reaches the intro
(H007+$09D8).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
